<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-ZANARDI WINS LONG BEACH INDYCAR.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-ZANARDI WINS LONG BEACH INDYCAR.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, California 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Allessandro Zanardi won the Long Beach Grand Prix CART IndyCar race in a Reynard Honda Sunday.</p>
<p>Mauricio Gugelmin of Brazil was second in a Reynard Mercedes-Benz. American Scott Pruett was third in a Reynard Ford.</p>
